{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36250","headline":"题越州袁秀才林亭 · 方干","name":"题越州袁秀才林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清邃林亭指画开，幽岩别派像天台。\n坐牵蕉叶题诗句，醉触藤花落酒杯。\n白鸟不归山里去，红鳞多自镜中来。\n终年此地爲吟伴，早起寻君薄暮回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}